title: "How Rewards Are Earned"
description: "Learn how buyers and creators earn eligibility for RugFreePump rewards."
---

RugFreePump rewards users based on qualifying activity during each reward period.

There are two reward categories:

- **Buyer rewards**
- **Creator rewards**

Each category uses its own qualification and ranking rules.

# Buyer Rewards

Buyers earn reward eligibility through qualifying bonding curve purchases.

Your qualifying purchase volume is tracked throughout the reward period and contributes to your buyer ranking.

At the end of the period, the **top 100 buyers** by qualifying purchase volume are eligible for a share of the buyer reward pool.

Higher qualifying purchase volume places you higher in the ranking and can result in a larger reward.

<Callout type="info" title="Buying More Does Not Guarantee a Reward">
Only the top 100 buyers qualify for buyer rewards during a reward period. Your final ranking depends on your qualifying purchase volume relative to other buyers during the same period.
</Callout>

# Creator Rewards

Creators earn reward eligibility through successful bonding curve liquidity migrations.

A creator must complete at least one successful migration during the reward period to qualify.

Creators are ranked primarily by their **total number of successful migrations** during the period.

The **top 100 creators** are eligible for a share of the creator reward pool.

When creators have the same number of successful migrations, qualifying buy volume is used as a ranking tie-breaker. If the relevant values remain tied, the protocol uses the applicable wallet-key ordering to determine the final ranking.

# What Counts Toward Your Rewards?

The Reward Program uses qualifying activity recorded during the reward period.

For buyers, this means qualifying bonding curve purchase volume.

For creators, this means successful bonding curve migrations.

The final qualifying activity is recorded when the reward period is finalized.

# Your Ranking Can Change

Rankings during an active reward period are not final.

For example, you may currently be ranked within the top 100 buyers, but another buyer can generate additional qualifying purchase volume and move ahead of you before the period ends.

The same applies to creator rankings as additional migrations are completed.

Only the finalized ranking at the end of the reward period determines eligibility.

# Reward Eligibility Summary

| Reward Type | How You Qualify | Eligible Participants |
| --- | --- | ---: |
| **Buyers** | Qualifying bonding curve purchase volume | Top 100 buyers |
| **Creators** | Successful bonding curve migrations | Top 100 creators |

For how these rankings are finalized, see [Reward Periods and Rankings](/reward-program/reward-periods-and-rankings).
