The RugFreePump Reward Program operates in recurring **28-day reward periods**.

Your qualifying activity is tracked throughout the period, while rankings can change as users generate additional qualifying activity.

When the period ends, RugFreePump finalizes the rankings and records the results in a permanent reward snapshot.

# Reward Periods

Each reward period lasts **28 days**.

During an active period:

- Buyer purchase volume is tracked.
- Creator migrations are tracked.
- Buyer rankings are updated as qualifying purchase volume changes.
- Creator rankings are updated as successful migrations occur.
- Estimated reward positions may change throughout the period.

The active ranking is not the final result.

<Callout type="info" title="Your Final Rank Is Determined at Period End">
A ranking shown during an active reward period can change before the period ends. Only the finalized ranking recorded in the period's reward snapshot determines reward eligibility.
</Callout>

# Buyer Rankings

Buyers are ranked by their qualifying bonding curve purchase volume during the reward period.

The buyer ranking is ordered from the highest qualifying purchase volume to the lowest.

The **top 100 buyers** at the end of the period qualify for buyer rewards.

# Creator Rankings

Creators are ranked primarily by the number of successful bonding curve migrations completed during the reward period.

A creator must have at least one successful migration to qualify.

When creators have the same number of successful migrations, qualifying buy volume is used as a tie-breaker.

If the relevant values remain tied, the protocol uses the applicable wallet-key ordering to determine the final ranking.

The **top 100 creators** in the finalized ranking qualify for creator rewards.

# Final Reward Snapshot

At the end of each 28-day period, RugFreePump creates a permanent snapshot containing the qualifying reward information for that period.

The snapshot records the finalized participants, rankings, qualifying activity, and calculated reward amounts.

Once finalized, the snapshot provides the permanent reference used for that reward period's distribution.

Changes to activity in a later reward period do not change the previous period's finalized snapshot.

# Ranking Summary

| Category | Primary Ranking Metric | Eligibility |
| --- | --- | ---: |
| **Buyers** | Qualifying purchase volume | Top 100 |
| **Creators** | Successful migrations | Top 100 |

Creator rankings use qualifying buy volume as a tie-breaker when migration counts are equal.

For how the reward amounts are calculated from the finalized rankings, see [Reward Calculation](/reward-program/reward-calculation).
